00:25:37.650 --> 00:25:40.310
Cukup pengalaman .

00:25:40.920 --> 00:25:44.650
Akane , kau sudah cukup dendam sudah .

00:25:48.660 --> 00:25:50.390
Aku lebih menyukaimu sebelumnya .

00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:52.820
Apa ?

00:25:52.930 --> 00:25:57.160
Kau ... cantik ... seksi ...

00:25:57.270 --> 00:25:58.960
Kau brengsek !

00:25:59.070 --> 00:26:01.540
Berhenti mengatakan itu !